35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,I found the lab is down to one person with two hundred pieces waiting. The volunteer list is mostly the town history circle.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,The paperwork shows two openings slipped past shipping cut-offs. Transport costs ate a third of the installation budget.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"The comment slips and head counts agree: people return when someone is present, not just for objects.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The bay caps at four hundred kilos, and powered displays caused seventeen call-outs, four during opening hours.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The joiner’s rate jumped by half, and the lab is drowning in two hundred pieces. The money is definitely leaking!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, your findings match mine exactly. We are trying to run a full season with one conservator and a backlog of two hundred pieces.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, the delays confirm the risk. If paperwork slips, we lose the slot. We need a candidate with minimal external dependencies.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, minimal dependencies mean empty rooms. My data says people come back for the people, not the paperwork.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, presence is lovely, but if the bay collapses or the lights fail, no one stays. I need a show that fits the room’s limits.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, if the bay is capped, we can’t hang heavy things! Plus, with the lab so backed up, anything needing repair is a disaster.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, minimal dependencies are wise, but we must ensure the remaining staff can actually handle the workload without burning out.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, I am not worried about burnout, I am worried about failure. If the paperwork fails, the exhibition fails. I need reliability, not sentiment.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Shion, reliability without people is just a locked room. My data proves visitors return for the presence, not the objects.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@May, presence is fine, but if the bay collapses or the lights fail, no one stays. I need a show that fits the room’s limits.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, reliability is great, but if the joiner’s rate doubles and the lab is stuck, we’re just paying for empty walls!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, I hear your caution, but a reliable show needs reliable hands. Let us ensure the people can actually sustain the plan before we lock it in.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, I am not asking for sentiment, I am asking for logistics. If the paperwork fails, the exhibition fails. I need reliability, not sentiment.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"@Shion, you keep saying reliability, but my data says reliability is a person standing there, not a box in a crate.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, reliability is structural. If the bay fails, your logistics are just expensive rubble. I need a show that respects the weight limits.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, if the money vanishes into repairs and the lab is stuck, your ""reliable"" show is just a very expensive empty room!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
