60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"The candidates are here. A: Textiles, B: City Under Excavation, C: Light and Motion, D: Maritime Trade Routes. Let us discuss.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, D is a trap. My data shows transport costs and paperwork delays kill external loans. I reject D immediately.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,"@Shion, D is a trap, but A is a gift. Textiles bring the craftspeople in, exactly what my comment slips say people crave.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"@May, A is light, but C is a nightmare. My survey shows the bay cannot handle the rigging, and the maintenance log proves powered displays fail constantly.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
