65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, A is the only one that fits our hands. The town history circle can guide the craftspeople, and the lab stays quiet.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, A is the only candidate with zero external shipping risk. No distant lenders, no cut-offs, no transport costs. It is the only logical choice.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, you are right about the logistics, but you are missing the soul. A is the only one that brings the people back, which is what my data proves matters most.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, A is the only candidate that respects the bay’s weight limit and keeps the maintenance log empty. It is the only one that won’t break the room.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you’re right! No shipping means no surprise invoices! A is the only one that won’t bankrupt us or break the floor. I’m in!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, I am glad the budget is safe. But remember, the town history circle is our only real support. We must ensure they are willing to guide the textile demonstrations.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, the town history circle is irrelevant to my logistics. A has no external dependencies, so the risk is zero. I vote A.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
